      "value": "@{67114f74fb43558c4795ab40|full_name} LODs exist for the purpose of optimization... So saying the type of person that cares about optimizing their avatars would also then not need it, is kind of an oxymoron. It's actually especially important for people who want to optimize their avatars, because it means we could make models that look nicely detailed up close, but that don't destroy everyone's performance from a distance. \n\nThis is why this is such an important feature, not just for general performance possibilities but because it gives more freedom to creators to make very high quality avatars that still render efficiently.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
